	Section:
		Text: Document and sections
			Style: topic
		Heading 1:
			Text: Metadata
		Paragraph: A `Document` needs a `Title`, which the viewer shows instead of the file name, and a `Language`, which the screen reader needs. `Subject`, `Author` and `Keywords` are optional. None of them is printed: they are in the document properties of the PDF.
			Style: intro
		Text: What this document declares
			Style: label
